        "vendored_path": "fixtures/core/antiunify/upstream.egg"
      },
      "classification": "finite-example",
      "adaptations": [
        "Retain all four rewrites, both source terms, the AU constructor, run 4, equality check, and extraction. Rename globals and qualify arithmetic for ours.",
        "Use the same renamed full program in encoded egglog with unqualified arithmetic. Omit exploratory print-stats diagnostics. The appended wrong-generalization control must reject AU equal to Num 3."
      ],
      "limitations": [
        "This small source exercises ordinary AU rewrite rules, not the native anti-unification implementation or a least-generality theorem.",
        "Add has only the source commutativity rewrite; do not assume associativity. Extracted forms may exchange Add children or print strings with different quoting, so stdout checks require stable subterms and the program retains its complete equality oracle.",
        "Egglog suppresses buffered extraction output when a later negative control fails; source cases require extraction output, while failing egglog controls require the check-failure diagnostic only."
      ],
