        "Preserve both rules, all three edge assertions, the node union before the run, run 10, and both source goals. Omit exploratory print-stats diagnostics.",
        "The validation checks missing reverse reachability and an inserted but unasserted encoded Edge; the negative control requires an absent reverse path and must fail. The original validation makes no corresponding edge assertion."
